  "how": "384 dies need 512 / w >= 384, i.e. w = 1: 100G single-lane ports, 32 planes = 32 TU chips (384 of 512 ports used), 12,288 single-lane cables (4x the 192-die array's 3,072 two-lane cables, 2x its lanes)",
